    "open_land": "The 190-record Green Belt snapshot was separated from currently empty Metropolitan Open Land and Local Green Space datasets. Zero rows were not used as designation clearance, and national or London policy was not converted into automatic refusal or exact boundary evidence.",
    "ancient_woodland": "The 44,373-record Planning Data layer, Natural England base inventory, revised completed-county inventory and standing advice were reconciled. Revised data takes precedence only in completed counties; absence and geometry were not treated as no feature, title or automatic prohibition.",
